## The island keeps its own appointments

Johnny fishes, reads, sleeps, builds things, and encounters visitors. In the screenshot above, a fishing trip has left him clinging to the palm tree while an octopus occupies the beach. That is quite a lot for a program whose job is to appear when you stop using the computer.

